# Case portrait ban list (mandatory)

**Canonical:** `dev/case-portraits/BANNED.md` + `server/bannedCasePortraits.js`

## Before serving or screenshotting a cached portrait

1. Check `isCasePortraitBanned(caseId)` — if banned, cache is **invalid** (treat as missing; regen only after Steve removes ban).
2. Run `node scripts/purge-banned-case-portraits.mjs` after updating the ban list.

## Never ship these failure modes

- Robotic / stock / photoreal headswap — not MeWorld sculptural CGI
- Distorted faces or destroyed IV layers
- ECG electrodes **on clothing** — bare chest / gown open (`CLINICAL_ACCURACY_RULES.md`)
- Same generated face copied across unrelated case IDs without uber lock

## Uber / catalog cases

Regen **only** from shipped `*-GAME-SCENE.png` + `CHARACTER-MAP` — not generic `patient-scene-female.png` Magnific edit.

## `*_mask.png` is not an O₂ mask

Internal alpha for IV layer compositing (`deriveIvMaskFromDiff`). Delete with base/iv when banning.
